    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "\nSituated within one of Cavan town's most established and convenient residential neighbourhoods, No. 46 Drumnavanagh offers the ideal blend of comfort and everyday convenience. Located just a short stroll from Cavan General Hospital and Cavan town centre, this turnkey four-bedroom home places schools, shops, cafés, restaurants, and recreational amenities all within easy reach.Presented in excellent decorative order throughout the property is filled with natural light and features spacious, well-balanced accommodation designed for family living. Extending to 105 sq. m approx. the accommodation comprises 2 reception rooms, kitchen / dining room, 4 bedrooms, family bathroom and guest w.c. To the rear of the property is a mature enclosed garden laid in lawn. A utility shed and boiler house add valuable storage and practicality. To the front, a spacious driveway provides ample off-street parking and is framed by attractive red-brick walls and piers.Combining a prime location with excellent presentation and practical living space, this superb property represents an outstanding opportunity for owner-occupiers and investors alike.Viewing is highly recommended and is by appointment through the sole selling agents."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "\nEntrance Porch - \nSliding doors, ceramic tiled floor.\n\nEntrance Hall - \nLaminate flooring, understairs storage, coving, carpeted stairs to first floor.\n\nLiving Room - 3.43m x 3.0m\nLaminate flooring, coving.\n\nKitchen Dining Room - \nLaminate flooring, coving, shaker style painted kitchen, door to rear.\n\nSitting Room - 5.3m x 2.37m\nLaminate flooring, coving, sliding patio doors.\n\nFirst Floor - \n\n\nBedroom 1 - 3.86m x 3.52m\nCarpeted, built in wardrobe.\n\nBedroom 2 - 3.02m x 2.6m\nCarpeted.\n\nBathroom - 2.16m x 2.05m\nFully tiled, w.c, wash hand basin, shower.\n\nBedroom 3 - 2.62m x 2.06m\nCarpeted.\n\nGuest w.c - 1.4m x 0.8m\n\n\nBedroom 4 - 3.51m x 2.57m\nCarpeted, built in wardrobe.\n\n"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "<ul><li>Oil fired central heating.</li><li>Enclosed garden to rear. </li><li>Pedestrian side access.</li><li>Boiler house and utility shed.</li><li>Concrete drive with off street parking.</li><li>Established residential area. </li><li>Prime location beside Cavan General Hospital.</ul>"
      },
